{"id":"fremder","lemma":"Fremder","pos":"noun","rank":2665,"glosses":["stranger (someone whom one does not know) (male or of unspecified gender)","stranger, foreigner (someone from a different country, or from a different part of a country)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e5/De-Fremder.ogg/De-Fremder.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Fremden","plural":"Fremde","feminine":"Fremde"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich war ein Fremder.","en":"I was a stranger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393411","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind keine Fremden.","en":"We're not strangers.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Ich sah dort eine fremde Frau.","en":"I saw a strange woman there.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"Ein Fremder steht vor dem Haus.","en":"A stranger is standing in front of the house.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"Wir trauen keinen Fremden.","en":"We don't trust strangers.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to trust"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]}]}